<p>Last updated November 5, 2026.</p>
<p>{{ site.name }} is operated by {{ site.operator }}, a Florida limited liability company. This policy describes what the site collects.</p>
<h2>What we collect</h2>
<p>We do not require accounts and do not sell personal information. If you use the contact form, we receive the name, email address and message you submit so we can reply. The form is processed by FormSubmit, which forwards it to us by email.</p>
<h2>Analytics</h2>
<p>We use Cloudflare Web Analytics, which measures page views without cookies and without tracking you across sites. Our host, GitHub Pages, may log IP addresses for security and operations.</p>
<h2 id="google-analytics">Google Analytics</h2>
<p>We use Google Analytics 4 (measurement ID G-XLWSHPBTEY), a service of Google LLC, to understand how visitors use this site. Google Analytics may set cookies such as <code>_ga</code> and <code>_ga_*</code> and collect information such as pages viewed, referring site, device and browser type, and an approximate location derived from IP address. See <a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/partner-sites" rel="noopener">How Google uses information from sites that use its services</a>. You can opt out with the <a href="https://tools.google.com/dlpage/gaoptout" rel="noopener">Google Analytics opt-out browser add-on</a>.</p>
<h2>Advertising</h2>
<p>We may show advertising, including Google AdSense. Google and other third-party vendors may use cookies to serve and measure ads. You can opt out of personalized ads at <a href="https://adssettings.google.com/">https://adssettings.google.com</a>.</p>
<h2>Your choices</h2>
<p>You can ask us to delete messages you sent through the contact form. Depending on where you live, laws such as the GDPR or state privacy laws may give you further rights. The site is not directed to children under 13 and we do not knowingly collect their information.</p>
<h2>Changes</h2>
<p>We may update this policy by posting a new version on this page. Questions go through our <a href="{{ '/contact/' | url }}">contact form</a>.</p>
